Package: lifeconformal
Type: Package
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Title: Conformal Prediction for Censored Life History Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lu", "Mao", email = "lmao@biostat.wisc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Conformal calibration of prediction regions for state occupation
    times from censored multistate event histories. Fits working outcome and
    censoring models on training subjects and calibrates a fixed prediction
    score on independent subjects. Provides inverse-probability and augmented
    calibration, deterministic Markov reward calculations, history-dependent
    flexible transition models, and explicit numerical diagnostics.
